[2026-01-30T00:14:02.782Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01LqsVXfprMczrhGfGNtjdT7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the Feature Scout idea generation for the Report Shell & Navigation context.\n\n**Summary: Feature Scout Ideas for Report Shell & Navigation Context**\n\nCreated 5 feature ideas for the Report Shell & Navigation context (ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7):\n\n1. **Split View Mode for Side-by-Side Comparison** - Like VS Code/Notion, add split panes to view two sections simultaneously (e.g., findings + sources). Resizable via drag handle.\n\n2. **Collapsible Sidebar with Mini Mode** - Like Slack/Discord, collapse sidebar to icon-only mode. Hover to expand temporarily. Remember state per user.\n\n3. **Browser-Style Tab History with Back/Forward** - Track navigation history within report. Add back/forward buttons and breadcrumbs. Support Alt+Left/Right shortcuts.\n\n4. **Quick Actions Toolbar with Common Operations** - Like Figma/Linear, add toolbar with share, export, print, theme toggle, fullscreen. Contextual actions per tab.\n\n5. **Pinned Items Sidebar Section** - Like Slack starred/Notion favorites, pin important findings/sources for quick access. Persist across sessions.\n\n**Observations about the Report Shell & Navigation codebase:**\n- Well-structured shell architecture with ReportShell, ReportView, ThemedSidebar separation\n- Dual theme support (radar/swiss) implemented throughout with consistent patterns\n- Good use of Framer Motion for animations and transitions\n- ThemedSidebar shows stats and red flags - ready for extension with pins/favorites\n- ReportView has clean tab state management - ready for history extension\n- Toolbar component exists but is minimal - space for quick actions\n- ReportModal handles loading, error, and success states cleanly\n- Escape key handling implemented at both modal and shell levels"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3740,"cache_read_input_tokens":137256,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3740},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"ed0ac20a-305e-4d39-99a4-5ce15bfb5853"}
